# Commit message template
# Activated with:  git config commit.template .gitmessage

# <type>: <short summary, imperative, <= 72 chars>
#
# Types: analysis | docs | ci | chore | fix | feat | integrity
#
# ── Body (why, not what) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Explain the reasoning and any evidence (file + offset, function, resource).

# ── Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Author must remain: NurMohammadDuari <NurMohammadDuari@users.noreply.github.com>
# If a MANIFEST.txt entry changed, say so here.
